  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "One day, Emmy was taking care of her gashapon machine (those claw prize machines), when she and her machine were abducted by the evil Dark Brain. However, the gashapons of the legendary heroes Ultraman, Gundam, Shaider and Kamen Rider, were freed from the machine. Now the heroes have to rescue Emmy from Dark Brain.\r\nthis is the same Emmy from the Great Battle and Super Robot Wars OG series."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Un jour, Emmy s'occupait de sa machine à gashapon (ces machines à griffes), quand elle et sa machine ont été enlevées par le maléfique Dark Brain. Cependant, les gazhapons des héros légendaires Ultraman, Gundam, Shaider et Kamen Rider, ont été libérés de la machine. Maintenant, les héros doivent sauver Emmy de Dark Brain.\nC'est le même Emmy de la série Great Battle and Super Robot Wars OG."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Eines Tages kümmerte sich Emmy um ihre Gashapon-Maschine (diese Klauenpreismaschinen), als sie und ihre Maschine vom bösen Dunklen Gehirn entführt wurden. Die Gashapons der legendären Helden Ultraman, Gundam, Shaider und Kamen Rider, wurden jedoch von der Maschine befreit. Jetzt müssen die Helden Emmy vor Dark Brain retten. Dies ist der gleiche Emmy aus der Great Battle- und Super Robot Wars OG-Serie."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "Un día, Emmy estaba cuidando de su máquina de gashapon (esas máquinas de premios de garras), cuando ella y su máquina fueron secuestradas por el malvado Dark Brain. Sin embargo, los gashapons de los héroes legendarios Ultraman, Gundam, Shaider y Kamen Rider, fueron liberados de la máquina. Ahora los héroes tienen que rescatar a Emmy de Dark Brain.\r\neste es el mismo Emmy de las series Great Battle y Super Robot Wars OG."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Un giorno, Emmy si stava prendendo cura della sua macchina gashapon (quelle macchine tipo ufo catcher), quando lei e la sua macchina furono rapite dal malvagio Dark Brain. Tuttavia, i gashapon dei leggendari eroi Ultraman, Gundam, Shaider e Kamen Rider, furono liberati dalla macchina. Ora gli eroi devono salvare Emmy da Dark Brain.\r\nquesto è lo stesso Emmy della serie Great Battle e Super Robot Wars OG."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "Um dia, Emmy estava cuidando de sua máquina gashapon (aquelas máquinas com garras), quando ela e sua máquina foram sequestradas pelo malvado Dark Brain. No entanto, os gashapons dos lendários heróis Ultraman, Gundam, Shaider e Kamen Rider, foram libertados da máquina. Agora os heróis precisam resgatar Emmy de Dark Brain.\r\neste é o mesmo Emmy das séries Great Battle e Super Robot Wars OG."
    }
  ],
